<Layout
	title="About GentleQuest — A Quiet Mental Health Companion"
	description="GentleQuest is a gentle AI mood tracker for anxiety, stress, and burnout — built for people who get overwhelmed by streak-based wellness apps. No streaks, no shame, no subscription."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-06-22')}
>
	<p>
		GentleQuest is a gentle AI mood tracker for anxiety, stress, and burnout. It's built for people who get overwhelmed by streak-based wellness apps — the ones that make you feel guilty for missing a day.
	</p>

	<h2>The problem we're solving</h2>
	<p>
		Most habit trackers and wellness apps use daily streaks and loss aversion to keep you "engaged." But for people dealing with anxiety, burnout, or ADHD, streaks don't motivate — they punish. Missing a day doesn't mean you failed. It means you were having a great day with friends, or you needed rest, or life happened.
	</p>

	<p>
		A streak counter calls all of that a failure. We think that's toxic.
	</p>

	<h2>What we built instead</h2>
	<p>
		GentleQuest replaces daily streaks with "Rhythm" — a rolling window that counts your cumulative active days. Missing one doesn't erase your progress. You don't start over. You just pick up where you left off, without the guilt.
	</p>

	<p>
		The app has four core features:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Mood tracking</strong> — quick check-ins with trends over time</li>
		<li><strong>AI chat companion</strong> — gentle, practical support when you need to talk</li>
		<li><strong>Daily self-care quests</strong> — tiny 2-5 minute steps like breathing, grounding, and reflection</li>
		<li><strong>Crisis resources</strong> — quick access to helplines when you need them</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Who it's for</h2>
	<p>
		GentleQuest is for anyone who wants a kinder relationship with their daily routine — especially people with anxiety, stress, burnout, or ADHD who get overwhelmed by "just do it" productivity culture.
	</p>

	<h2>Privacy</h2>
	<p>
		Your data stays yours. Encrypted by design. We never sell your data. No ads. No tracking. No selling your mental health data to third parties.
	</p>

	<h2>Try it</h2>
	<p>
		GentleQuest is free and available on both stores:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gentlequest-ai-mood-tracker/id6756537464">Download for iOS</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=app.gentlequest.www">Get it on Google Play</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://app.gentlequest.app"><strong>Or check in on the web — 5 seconds, no download</strong></a></li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Medical disclaimer</h2>
	<p>
		GentleQuest is for support and self-care and is not a medical device. It does not diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or mental health condition. If you are in immediate danger, contact your local emergency services or a crisis hotline right away.
	</p>
</Layout>
